rowser instability.</span></p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><a class=\"group p-8 rounded-3xl border transition-all duration-300 bg-[#0f0f12] hover:bg-slate-900/50 border-red-500/30\" href=\"/test/chaos/oom\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-red-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-red-400 transition-colors\">OOM Memory Trap</h3><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Exponential array growth &amp; heap exhaustion</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500 group-hover:text-white transition-colors\">Execute Trap <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left w-4 h-4 rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path></svg></div></div></a><a class=\"group p-8 rounded-3xl border transition-all duration-300 bg-[#0f0f12] hover:bg-slate-900/50 border-orange-500/30\" href=\"/test/chaos/gpu\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-orange-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"ro